        "original_id": "9f259f25-d6f7-58db-9e9d-29c646035d9f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Auction Kings, Pawn Stars, Jersey Shore\n- Companies: History Channel, Discovery Channel, Gallery 63\n- People: Lori Verderame\n- Places: Sandy Springs, Georgia, Roswell Road, Atlanta\n\nFacts:\n- Pawn Stars debuted on July 26, 2009.\n- Pawn Stars became the History Channel's highest-rated show and the No. 2 reality show behind Jersey Shore.\n- Auction Kings premiered on October 26, 2010.\n- Auction Kings capitalized on the success of Pawn Stars.\n- Auction Kings featured the now-defunct auction house Gallery 63.\n- Gallery 63 was located in Sandy Springs, Georgia, on Roswell Road immediately north of the Atlanta city limit.\n- Lori Verderame is the main appraiser on the American TV show Auction Kings.\n- Auction Kings airs internationally on Discovery Channel.",
